# Raw discovery dumps. Never commit these: they contain full raw API
# responses from a private ESPN league, and this repo is public.
# Rule from handoff section 4 - this entry must exist before discover.py
# is ever run.
discovery/*

# FINDINGS.md is hand-written prose summarising discovery. It carries no
# raw responses, no cookies, no headers. It is the review artifact, so it
# is the one thing under discovery/ that is tracked.
!discovery/FINDINGS.md

# Never commit credentials in any form.
.env
.env.*
*.cookies
secrets.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
